## Conclusion

The best approach is to identify, monitor, control, and verify the faulty process. Using `top`, `ps`, `pidstat`, `renice`, `CPUQuota`, and `kill` allows the administrator to control CPU usage without restarting the system. Critical services can continue operating without interruption.

